PATCH-world-trees.diff: the canopy blobs of buildSakura and buildGrove
shaded round, their normals taken from the sphere each blob stands for
rather than from its twenty faces (POLISH-PLAN item 22). Drawing only:
every blob, box and collider is built from the same numbers as before.
Applies with git apply from the repository root, which skips this preamble.

